---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BricsGame from '../../components/BricsGame.astro';
import WeeklyNews from '../../components/WeeklyNews.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="金砖市场与货币 | 证券交易所、汇率与顶尖企业"
  description="金砖国家证券交易所、外汇汇率、forex趋势及顶尖企业的实时资讯。覆盖巴西、俄罗斯、印度、中国、南非及金砖新成员国。"
  lang="zh"
>
  <Fragment slot="logo">BRICS Markets</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="footer-name">BRICS Markets & Currencies</Fragment>

  <section class="bb-hero">
    <div class="bb-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="bb-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="bb-hero-content">
      <h1 class="bb-title">金砖市场与货币</h1>
      <p class="bb-tagline">金砖国家证券交易所、外汇汇率与顶尖企业的实时资讯</p>
      <p class="bb-lead">追踪全球增长最快经济体的新兴市场机遇。从孟买证券交易所到上证综指，从雷亚尔到卢布——您通往金砖国家金融情报的门户。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ad-slot">广告位 - Google AdSense</div>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <article class="card"><a href="/zh/bse-and-nse-india/">
      <h2>金砖国家证券交易所</h2>
      <p>全面覆盖印度的BSE和NSE、中国的上海和深圳交易所、巴西的B3、俄罗斯的MOEX以及南非的JSE。实时指数、交易量和市值分析。</p>
    </a></article>
    <article class="card"><a href="/zh/indian-rupee/">
      <h2>外汇汇率</h2>
      <p>实时追踪人民币、印度卢比、巴西雷亚尔、俄罗斯卢布、南非兰特、埃及镑和阿联酋迪拉姆的汇率。交叉货币对分析、历史趋势及央行政策对金砖汇率的影响。</p>
    </a></article>
    <article class="card"><a href="/zh/invest-in-brics/">
      <h2>增长最快的企业</h2>
      <p>发现金砖国家增长最快的上市公司。按行业分析科技、能源、金融和制造业领域推动新兴市场增长的领军企业。</p>
    </a></article>
    <article class="card"><a href="/zh/brics-currency/">
      <h2>金砖货币指数</h2>
      <p>追踪拟议中的金砖通用货币和去美元化进程。分析双边货币互换协议以及远离美元计价贸易的趋势。</p>
    </a></article>
    <article class="card"><a href="/zh/brics-summit/">
      <h2>大宗商品与资源</h2>
      <p>石油、黄金、稀土和农产品——金砖国家如何主导全球大宗商品市场。价格追踪、供应链分析和资源驱动的投资机会。</p>
    </a></article>
    <article class="card"><a href="/zh/invest-in-brics/">
      <h2>投资机会</h2>
      <p>面向国际投资者的ETF、ADR及直接投资金砖市场的途径。监管指南、风险评估及新兴市场敞口的投资组合策略。</p>
    </a></article>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-slot">广告位 - Google AdSense</div>

  <section class="guide-index">
    <h2>指南与讲解</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/zh/bse-and-nse-india/">BSE &amp; NSE (India)</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/shanghai-and-shenzhen-china/">Shanghai &amp; Shenzhen (China)</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/b3-brazil/">B3 (Brazil)</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/moex-russia-index/">MOEX (Russia)</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/jse-south-africa/">JSE (South Africa)</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/renminbi-cny/">Renminbi</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/brazilian-real/">Brazilian real</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/indian-rupee/">Indian rupee</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/south-african-rand/">South African rand</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/russian-ruble/">Russian ruble</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/brics-currency/">Is there a BRICS currency?</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/invest-in-brics/">How to invest</a></li>
      <li><a href="/zh/brics-summit/">BRICS &amp; the summit</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <BricsGame lang="zh" />

  <div class="ad-slot">Ad Space</div>

  <WeeklyNews lang="zh" />

  <div class="ad-slot">Ad Space</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .bb-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: -40px -20px 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .bb-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/images/bricsbrother.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }
  .bb-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,
      rgba(0,0,0,.7) 50%,
      rgba(0,0,0,.85) 100%
    );
  }
  .bb-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }
  .bb-title {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .bb-tagline {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.95);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .bb-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .bb-title { font-size: 2.4rem; }
    .bb-tagline { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .bb-lead { font-size: 1rem; }
  }

  .card a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; display: block; }
  .card a:hover { text-decoration: none; }
  .card a h2 { color: #fff; }
  .guide-index {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 32px 0;
  }
  .guide-index h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .guide-index ul {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px 24px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;
  }
  .guide-index li { padding: 3px 0; }
  .guide-index a { color: #6ba3d6; }
  .guide-index a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

</style>
